    "explanation": "Inclusive pedagogy responds to learner diversity by expanding the learning opportunities ordinarily available to everyone, while maintaining meaningful participation and intellectual challenge. It asks teachers to anticipate variation in access, representation, engagement, and expression within shared classroom activity.\n\nIt does not eliminate individual accommodations, specialist support, or differences in goals where these are genuinely needed. It resists treating separation as the automatic first response to difference.",
    "explanationZh": "全纳教学法通过扩展通常向所有人开放的学习机会来回应学习者差异，同时保持有意义的参与和智力挑战。它要求教师在共同课堂活动中，预先考虑获取信息、理解表达、参与方式和成果呈现的多样性。\n\n它不会取消真正需要的个别调整、专业支持或目标差异，而是拒绝把分离当成面对差异时自动出现的第一答案。"
