    "explanation": "Opportunity cost is the value of the next-best feasible alternative forgone when a choice is made. It reflects scarcity and can include time, output, experience, risk, or other valued outcomes, not only money.\n\nIt is not the sum of all rejected options and may change as prices, technology, constraints, and preferences change. Comparing realistic alternatives makes the trade-off of a decision explicit.",
    "explanationZh": "机会成本是一项选择作出时，被放弃的次佳可行替代方案的价值。它反映稀缺性，可以包含时间、产出、体验、风险或其他有价值结果，不只包括金钱。\n\n它不是所有未选方案的总和，也会随价格、技术、约束和偏好变化。比较现实可行的替代，能够使决策取舍变得明确。"
