    "explanation": "Journalistic verification tests claims through original material, provenance, direct observation, source competence, independent corroboration, contextual checks, and comparison with alternative explanations. Complex claims should be separated into components that may have different evidential status.\n\nVerification is an ongoing discipline rather than a guarantee of certainty. Responsible reporting records what is known, inferred, disputed, and unknown, then updates or corrects the account as evidence changes.",
    "explanationZh": "新闻核实通过原始材料、来源轨迹、直接观察、来源能力、独立佐证、语境检查与替代解释比较来检验主张。复杂说法应拆成证据状态可能不同的组成部分。\n\n核实是一项持续纪律，并非确定性的保证。负责任的报道会记录哪些是已知、推断、有争议与未知，并在证据变化时更新或纠正。"
