    "explanation": "The time value of money means that equal nominal amounts at different dates are generally not economically equivalent. Earlier funds can earn returns, while delayed cash flows may involve inflation, default risk, liquidity limits, and postponed consumption or investment.\n\nFuture value compounds a present amount forward; present value discounts a future amount back. The chosen rate and compounding convention must fit the risk, term, alternatives, purpose, and affected parties rather than being treated as universal.",
    "explanationZh": "货币时间价值指不同日期的相同名义金额通常不具经济等价性。较早资金可产生回报，延后现金流则可能涉及通胀、违约风险、流动限制及消费或投资推迟。\n\n终值把当前金额向未来复利计算，现值把未来金额折回现在。所用利率与复利方式应符合风险、期限、替代方案、目的和受影响者，不能视为普遍常数。"
