    "explanation": "Customer lifetime value estimates the present value of expected future contribution from a customer relationship. Models commonly include revenue, variable margin, retention or churn, timing, and relevant acquisition, retention, or service costs.\n\nIt is uncertain and partly shaped by the firm's own treatment of customers. CLV should inform resource decisions without becoming a moral ranking, and models require validation, sensitivity analysis, privacy protection, and fairness review.",
    "explanationZh": "客户终身价值估计客户关系预期未来贡献的现值。模型通常包括收入、可变利润、留存或流失、时间，以及相关获客、维系或服务成本。\n\n它具有不确定性，也部分受企业自身对待顾客的方式塑造。客户终身价值可支持资源决定，却不应成为道德排名；模型需要验证、敏感性分析、隐私保护与公平审查。"
