    "explanation": "A mass balance states that accumulation within a defined system equals inflow minus outflow plus generation minus consumption of the tracked quantity over a stated interval.\n\nTotal mass is conserved in ordinary chemical processes, while individual species may react. Boundary choice, holdup, steady versus transient operation, units, sampling, and measurement uncertainty are essential to a valid balance.",
    "explanationZh": "物料衡算指出，在规定时间内，定义系统中的积累等于流入减流出，再加所追踪量的生成减消耗。\n\n普通化学过程中总质量守恒，单一物种却可能反应。边界选择、持液、稳态与瞬态、单位、采样及测量不确定性，是有效衡算的必要部分。"
