    "explanation": "Energy storage and intermittency concern the mismatch between variable supply and demand. Storage shifts energy through time but is constrained separately by power, capacity, duration, efficiency, response, degradation, safety, and location.\n\nStorage complements transmission, interconnection, flexible demand, forecasting, diverse generation, and firm capacity. Its emissions and system value depend on when, where, and from what source it charges and discharges.",
    "explanationZh": "储能与间歇性处理可变供给同需求之间的时间错配。储能把能量穿过时间转移，却分别受功率、容量、时长、效率、响应、衰减、安全与位置约束。\n\n储能补充输电、互联、灵活需求、预测、多样发电与可靠容量。其排放和系统价值取决于何时、何地、从何种来源充放电。"
