    "explanation": "Anisotropy means that a material's properties depend on direction. Fibres, grains, layers, crystals, pores, forming, and manufacturing can create preferred axes.\n\nStiffness, strength, fracture, swelling, thermal expansion, permeability, and other responses may each have different directional patterns. Tests and designs must identify orientation, environment, variability, and loading mode.",
    "explanationZh": "各向异性指材料性质取决于方向。纤维、晶粒、层片、晶体、孔隙、成形与制造都可能建立优选轴。\n\n刚度、强度、断裂、湿胀、热膨胀、渗透等响应可能各有不同方向规律。试验与设计必须说明方向、环境、变异与加载方式。"
