    "explanation": "Design for circularity creates products and supporting systems that preserve value through durability, maintenance, repair, reuse, remanufacture, and suitable material recovery while reducing waste and leakage.\n\nIt depends on material compatibility, joining, disassembly, information, safety, collection, reverse logistics, economics, user behaviour, and real infrastructure. Theoretical recyclability alone does not close a loop.",
    "explanationZh": "循环设计让产品及支撑系统通过耐用、维护、修理、复用、再制造和适当材料回收来保存价值，同时减少废物与泄漏。\n\n它取决于材料相容、连接、拆解、信息、安全、收集、逆向物流、经济、用户行为与真实基础设施。理论可回收性本身不能闭合循环。"
