    "explanation": "Grain and pattern alignment orients garment pieces to warp, weft, bias, stretch, drape, nap, motifs, and reference marks so the assembled product hangs, moves, and appears as intended.\n\nFabric relaxation, shrinkage, seam feeding, curved geometry, matching, and care conditions matter. Bias cutting can be deliberate, but it requires support and allowance for directional deformation.",
    "explanationZh": "纹理与版型对齐让成衣裁片依照经、纬、斜向、伸展、垂坠、绒向、图案与基准标记定向，使组合后按预期垂落、运动与呈现。\n\n织物松弛、缩水、缝线送布、曲面几何、对花与护理条件都重要。斜裁可以是有意设计，但要为方向变形提供支撑与余量。"
