    "explanation": "Human scale shapes built environments around how people perceive, move, reach, pause, interact, and experience conditions at bodily speed and distance.\n\nProportion combines with edges, time, shelter, sensory detail, accessibility, climate, safety, maintenance, and diverse bodies. It does not require every space to be small or assume one average person.",
    "explanationZh": "人性尺度依照人们在身体速度与距离中怎样感知、移动、伸手、停留、互动与体验环境来塑造建成空间。\n\n比例还要同边缘、时间、遮蔽、感官细节、无障碍、气候、安全、维护与多样身体结合。它不要求每处空间都小，也不假设只有一种平均人。"
