    "explanation": "A load path is the continuous route by which gravity, environmental, imposed, and accidental actions pass through structural elements and connections into supports and the ground.\n\nEach transfer must address strength, stiffness, stability, ductility, durability, directions, combinations, construction stages, and failure modes. Strong components cannot compensate for a missing or incompatible connection.",
    "explanationZh": "荷载路径是重力、环境、使用与偶然作用通过结构构件和连接，传到支座与大地的连续路线。\n\n每次传递都要处理强度、刚度、稳定、延性、耐久、方向、组合、施工阶段与失效方式。强构件无法补偿缺失或不相容的连接。"
