    "collection": "field-core-fables",
    "storyBody": "Engineer Daro designed a footbridge from the river's ten-year average flow and the timber yard's average strength certificate. On most days it felt rigid. During an exceptional flood, faster water carried debris against the piers and scoured soil from one foundation. The deck remained below its breaking load, yet the support rotated and the bridge closed before anyone was hurt. Daro had compared two averages as if unusual demand and weak resistance would politely avoid the same day.\n\nReviewer Mira listed uncertainty on both sides. Loads varied with occupancy, wind, water, snow, impact, construction, and future use. Resistance varied with dimensions, material scatter, workmanship, deterioration, model error, and how force actually entered each connection. Demand and resistance also shared dependencies that could move them together. She compared nominal capacity with nominal demand to see available margin, but the ratio alone meant little unless values, failure mode, reliability basis, and consequences were stated.\n\nModern design provisions did not simply multiply every dimension by one traditional number. They used characteristic values, separate factors or combinations for different actions and resistances, and calibrated rules for relevant limit states. A frequent service condition governed vibration and deflection; a rare ultimate condition governed collapse resistance. Load combinations recognised that every variable maximum was unlikely to occur simultaneously, while certain dependent events, such as flood and scour, could not be treated as independent conveniences.\n\nDaro proposed doubling the deck beams. Mira traced the failure and kept the foundations in view. Extra deck capacity would not replace missing scour protection, lateral stability, connection ductility, or a correct hydraulic model. Different modes demanded different margins, and a brittle failure with little warning deserved different treatment from a visible, repairable deformation. Consequence class, redundancy, inspection access, and evacuation possibilities also influenced acceptable reliability.\n\nThe redesigned bridge used applicable standards, qualified analysis, site data, robust detailing, and independent checking. It also carried an inspection and maintenance plan because decay and river geometry changed after construction. Climate and land-use shifts could make the historical record less representative. Mira treated margin as one layer among good models, quality control, monitoring, restrictions, and timely intervention, not as permission to stop asking how the bridge might fail.\n\nThe closed bridge taught factor of safety: a stated ratio between a measure of resistance and a corresponding measure of demand, used to provide margin for uncertainty and variability under a defined method. Its meaning depends on whether values are nominal, allowable, ultimate, or otherwise specified; many codes instead or additionally use separate load and resistance factors calibrated to target reliability. No factor guarantees safety when the model, failure mode, construction, deterioration, or load case is wrong. Daro had added averages. Mira designed for the uncertain distance between them.",
    "storyBodyZh": "工程师达罗用河流十年平均流量和木材场平均强度证书设计一座步行桥。多数日子里，它十分坚挺。一次罕见洪水中，更快水流把漂浮物推向桥墩，又冲走一处基础周围的土。桥面尚未达到断裂载荷，支座却发生转动，桥在无人受伤前关闭。达罗把两个平均数放在一起，仿佛异常需求与较弱抗力会礼貌地避开同一天。\n\n复核工程师米拉列出两侧不确定性。荷载随人群、风、水、雪、撞击、施工与未来用途变化；抗力随尺寸、材料离散、施工质量、劣化、模型误差及力怎样真正进入连接而变化。需求与抗力还可能共享会让二者一起移动的依赖。她比较名义承载力与名义需求，查看可用裕度；但若不说明数值类型、失效方式、可靠度依据与后果，这个比值本身意义有限。\n\n现代设计规定不会简单地把每个尺寸乘上一个传统数字，而会对不同作用和抗力采用特征值、独立分项或组合，并针对相关极限状态校准规则。常见使用状态控制振动与挠度，罕见极限状态控制抗倒塌。荷载组合承认所有变量峰值不太可能同时发生，也承认洪水与冲刷这类相关事件不能被方便地当成相互独立。\n\n达罗提议把桥面梁加倍。米拉追踪真实失效，视线仍留在基础。更多桥面能力不能替代缺失的抗冲刷、侧向稳定、连接延性或正确水力模型。不同失效方式需要不同裕度，毫无预警的脆性破坏也应区别于可见、可修复的变形。后果等级、冗余、检查通道与撤离可能同样影响可接受可靠度。\n\n重建桥梁采用适用标准、合格分析、场地数据、稳健构造与独立复核。它还带着检查维护计划，因为腐朽与河道几何会在建成后改变。气候与土地使用变化也可能让历史记录不再具有代表性。米拉把裕度当成良好模型、质量控制、监测、限制与及时干预中的一层，而不是停止追问桥会怎样失效的许可。\n\n关闭的桥教授的是安全系数：在规定方法下，用某种抗力度量与相应需求度量的比值，为不确定性与变异提供裕度。它的意义取决于数值是名义、容许、极限还是其他定义；许多规范还会改用或同时使用按目标可靠度校准的荷载与抗力分项系数。若模型、失效方式、施工、劣化或荷载情景错误，没有一个系数能保证安全。达罗曾把平均数相加，米拉设计的是它们之间那段不确定距离。",
    "explanation": "Factor of safety is a defined ratio between a measure of resistance and a corresponding measure of demand, providing margin for variability and uncertainty under a stated design method.\n\nIts interpretation depends on value definitions and failure mode. Codes may use calibrated load and resistance factors instead or as well. Correct models, combinations, detailing, construction, inspection, and maintenance remain essential.",
    "explanationZh": "安全系数是在规定设计方法下，某种抗力度量与相应需求度量之间的定义比值，用来为变异与不确定性提供裕度。\n\n解释取决于数值定义与失效方式，规范也可能改用或同时使用校准后的荷载与抗力分项系数。正确模型、组合、构造、施工、检查与维护仍不可缺。"
