    "explanation": "Graded exposure is planned, collaborative, repeated engagement with assessed feared situations or activities in workable steps to reduce avoidance and support new learning.\n\nIt is not coercive flooding or proof that danger and symptoms are unreal. Suitability, pacing, safeguards, goals, medical factors, trauma context, and professional guidance must be individualised.",
    "explanationZh": "分级暴露是对经过评估且令人恐惧的情境或活动，按可执行步骤进行有计划、协作和反复接触，以减少回避并支持新学习。\n\n它不是强制性洪水式暴露，也不证明危险或症状虚假。适用性、节奏、防护、目标、医学因素、创伤情境与专业指导都必须个体化。"
