    "explanation": "The biopsychosocial model understands health, illness, functioning, and disability through interactions among biological, psychological, and social processes across time and levels.\n\nIt does not deny biological pathology, make symptoms imaginary, or require equal weight for every factor. Individual formulations should identify relevant pathways, guide proportionate action, and be revised against evidence and outcomes.",
    "explanationZh": "生物心理社会模型通过生物、心理与社会过程跨时间和层级的相互作用，理解健康、疾病、功能与失能。\n\n它不否认生物病理，不把症状变成虚构，也不要求每项因素权重相等。个体化解释应识别相关路径、指导合比例行动，并依据证据与结局修订。"
