    "explanation": "Pharmacokinetics describes how absorption, distribution, metabolism, and excretion shape a drug's concentration over time.\n\nRoute, bioavailability, distribution, clearance, half-life, repeated dosing, individual physiology, and interactions all influence exposure. These models support qualified dosing and monitoring; they do not replace clinical assessment.",
