    "explanation": "The therapeutic alliance is the collaborative relationship built through shared goals, agreed therapeutic tasks, and a bond of trust and respect.\n\nIt can support engagement and outcome, including through rupture and repair, but is not friendship or sufficient treatment by itself. Competence, boundaries, evidence, consent, and safety remain essential.",
    "explanationZh": "治疗联盟是通过共同目标、商定的治疗任务，以及信任与尊重的联结所建立的合作关系。\n\n它可通过关系裂痕与修复支持参与和结局，却不是友谊，也不能独自构成充分治疗。胜任能力、边界、证据、同意与安全仍不可缺少。"
