    "explanation": "Periodisation is the planned organisation and variation of training over time to manage adaptation and fatigue and prepare desired capacities for important periods.\n\nIt coordinates load, recovery, specificity, and sequencing across nested cycles. Plans should remain responsive, and no single named model is universally best for every athlete, sport, or outcome.",
