    "explanation": "Tourism carrying capacity is the level and pattern of visitor use a destination can accommodate without unacceptable environmental, physical, social, cultural, economic, or experiential deterioration.\n\nIt is multidimensional and depends on place, time, behaviour, infrastructure, management, values, and desired conditions. Monitoring and adaptive limits are usually more useful than one permanent visitor number.",
